1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,020
To the ones we've lost along the way

2
00:00:02,260 --> 00:00:04,500
Who fought it to the end

3
00:00:05,540 --> 00:00:09,220
Passing never made you weak

4
00:00:09,460 --> 00:00:12,580
It made you human, friend

5
00:00:12,660 --> 00:00:15,940
And the strong ain't the ones who never fall

6
00:00:16,420 --> 00:00:19,780
Or the ones who never cry

7
00:00:19,780 --> 00:00:21,000
They're the ones who let you hold them
